rem Grid Graphs
rem https://projecteuler.net/problem=716

use numbers
use io
use cli

arg Height integer = 10000
arg Width integer = 20000
arg Prime integer = 1000000007

rem Closed form for the sum of the
rem component counts, checked against
rem all three given values:
rem C = 2hw (2^h + 2^w + 1) + 9 2^(h+w)
rem - (8w + 10) 2^h - (8h + 10) 2^w
rem + 10 (h + w + 1)
PowH = 2 Height Prime powmod
PowW = 2 Width Prime powmod
Area = Height * Width mod Prime
Sum = (PowH + PowW + 1) mod Prime
Main = 2 * Area * Sum mod Prime
Mixed = 9 * PowH mod Prime
Cross = Mixed * PowW mod Prime
CutW = (8 * Width + 10) * PowH mod Prime
Side = 8 * Height + 10
CutH = Side * PowW mod Prime
Linear = 10 * (Height + Width + 1)
Total = Main + Cross - CutW - CutH
Answer = (Total + Linear) mod Prime
Answer print
